      "author_association": "NONE",
      "body": "1. Turn on VoiceOver\r\n2. Focus on an editor -> the first line of text is always read no matter where the cursor is\r\n\r\nI believe this is a regression due to your change to use the first line for Untitled editors. Since this works just fine for VS Code stable.\r\nHowever I see this for all editors, not only untitled ones.\r\n@bpasero Can you take a look, and if you do not know what is going on feel free to assign back to me\r\n\r\nfyi @ivanfetch",
